# Files in this repo that must NOT be published as static assets.
#
# Cloudflare Workers Static Assets uploads everything in the assets directory,
# which here is the repo root. Without this file the first deployment served
# the whole .git directory — /.git/config, /.git/HEAD and /.git/logs/HEAD all
# returned 200. GitHub Pages excludes .git implicitly, so this is a difference
# between the two hosts, not something inherited.
#
# The repo is public, so nothing secret leaked. It is still worth closing: it
# is what security scanners flag first, and it would become a real breach the
# day this repo goes private or someone commits a credential.
#
# NOTE: _headers is deliberately absent. Cloudflare consumes it as
# configuration and does not serve it, so ignoring it would silently drop
# every security and caching header.

# Version control internals
.git
.gitignore
.gitattributes
.assetsignore

# Host-specific config that has no business being fetchable
wrangler.jsonc
CNAME
.nojekyll

# Repo documentation — lives on GitHub, not on the website
CLAUDE.md
README.md

# The compiler, and brand sources the site never references at runtime
tools
brand
